@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@orderId = 1
@cancelKey = replace-with-a-new-unique-key
@adminCancelKey = replace-with-a-different-unique-key

### Customer: cancel own order before shipment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{cancelKey}}

### Repeat the request with the same key to replay the original response
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{cancelKey}}

### Admin: cancel any unshipped order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{adminCancelKey}}

### Read final order state (allocations are zero after cancellation)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}
